er  i hope that demo showed you how easy it  can be to not only deploy a gke  autopilot cluster but also how simple it  can be to migrate an existing vm based  workload to kubernetes for more detailed  information check out our documentation  as well as the other videos in our  migrate series and don't forget to like  and subscribe to be alerted whenever we  publish new content  [Music]
 

